.SH NAME
ivcap-collection-add - Add item(s) to an existing collection


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBivcap collection add collectionURN [urn...] [--dir ] [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Add one or more items to an existing collection.

.PP
Items can be specified in two ways (both may be combined):
.IP "  1." 5
As positional URN arguments after the collection URN.
.IP "  2." 5
Via --dir: a directory path or glob pattern. Each matching file is
 uploaded as an artifact (skipped if already uploaded) and the resulting
 artifact URN is used as the item.

.PP
A 'collection-item' aspect (urn:ivcap:schema:collection-item.1) is created for
each new item. Duplicates (same collection + item) are detected and skipped.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--dir\fP=""
	Directory or glob pattern of files to upload and add

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for add


